/Superior_Material_(-1)\" title=\"Superior Material (-1)\">Superior Material</a></dt><dd>You take 1 less <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a> damage.</dd></dl><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Countershock\" title=\"Countershock\">Countershock</a></dt><dd>When the wearer takes damage while having <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning Charges\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\">Lightning Charges</a>, the attacker must succeed a <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throw</a> or become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocked_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocked (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shocked\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocked_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocked (Condition)\">Shocked</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim_Basement\" title=\"Zhentarim Basement\">Zhentarim Basement</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;295&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-250</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brem\" title=\"Brem\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/25px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/38px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/50px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Brem\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/25px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Brem\" title=\"Brem\">Brem</a> after completing the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_Missing_Shipment\" title=\"Find the Missing Shipment\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find the Missing Shipment\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_Missing_Shipment\" title=\"Find the Missing Shipment\">Find the Missing Shipment</a></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Countershock:</i></p>\n<ul><li><b>Countershock</b> displays a saving throw in the combat log even when the wearer is without Lightning Charges, but <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocked_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocked (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shocked\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocked_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocked (Condition)\">Shocked</a> is not applied in this case.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Models</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 98.666666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 96.666666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_Jolty_Vest_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Front Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/The_Jolty_Vest_Human_Front_Model.webp/145px-The_Jolty_Vest_Human_Front_Model.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/The_Jolty_Vest_Human_Front_Model.webp/218px-The_Jolty_Vest_Human_Front_Model.webp 1.5x, /w/images/7/7e/The_Jolty_Vest_Human_Front_Model.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Jolty Vest Human Front\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/The_Jolty_Vest_Human_Fro